# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. node/.env holds DAML_PACKAGE_ID, the database password
# (DATABASE_URL, TEST_DATABASE_URL) and the LocalNet JWT secret
# (DAML_UNSAFE_JWT_SECRET) or a ledger token (DAML_LEDGER_TOKEN). .env.example is the tracked template
# and is deliberately NOT excluded by these rules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies. package-lock.json IS tracked -- it is what makes an install
# reproducible.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Daml build output. `.daml/` (with the leading dot) is dpm's build directory;
# it vendors a full copy of daml-script's and this project's own sources, so
# it is large, entirely regenerable by `dpm build --all`, and would otherwise
# bury the three real .daml source files. The source directories `daml/` and
# `daml-tests/` are NOT matched by this pattern.
#
# DARs are build artifacts too, and a stale one committed alongside a changed
# source is worse than no DAR at all -- the package id is read from the DAR's
# own manifest, so a wrong one is actively misleading.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.daml/
*.dar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch and throwaway work. Every package migration in
# the project's history produced one-off enumeration/archive/verification
# scripts; the convention is a leading underscore in node/, and they are
# deliberately not kept -- what they did is the part worth keeping, not the
# scripts themselves.
# docs/m*-live-run.txt is rewritten by every verify-all run, and the evidence
# worth keeping from those runs is recorded in a document outside this copy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_*.mjs
_*.js
scratch-*
*.log
docs/m*-live-run.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
